    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "2BFC242B68E5F7DE",
      "text": "What brings you back here, baby? Finally ready\\nfor that rap battle?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D9AB61BFDCE1FFB2",
      "text": "I’m here for the Gym inspection!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D9AB60BFDCE1FDFF",
      "text": "Yeah! A rap battle sounds great!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_03a",
      "hash64": "A36D18C33EC7B2D0",
      "text": "Hold on. You’re telling me La Primera sent YOU\\nto check on my Gym?![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_03b",
      "hash64": "A36D1BC33EC7B7E9",
      "text": "Hah! So you’re a Champion Rank comedian too![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "2BFC262B68E5FB44",
      "text": "So instead of her, I get you...[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "2BFC272B68E5FCF7",
      "text": "She sent a rookie Champion instead of comin’\\nout here herself?\\c\\nDoesn’t she know who I am?![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "2BFC282B68E5FEAA",
      "text": "Sorry, I got heated there. Don’t worry, though—\\nyou aren’t the one who struck that nerve.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "2BFC292B68E6005D",
      "text": "Oh well. I was just thinkin’ I’d like to see you\\nagain anyway. Guess this is just how fate has it![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "2BFC1A2B68E5E6E0",
      "text": "If we’re doin’ this, let’s do it. Ready to show me\\nhow strong all those adventures made you?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_retry",
      "hash64": "D3F660C65FD8455A",
      "text": "You ready to show me how strong you are\\nnow, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "2BFC1B2B68E5E893",
      "text": "Now THAT’s the spirit! C’mon, let’s put on a\\nkiller show![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "2BFFA82B68E90E01",
      "text": "No? Then what’d you come here for? Come back\\nwhen you’re ready to go![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_nobattle",
      "hash64": "59E832E7A5A187B5",
      "text": "Hey now! You’re gonna need at least two\\nPokémon in battlin’ shape to take me on![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
